{"3765700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clown Camp", "steam_appid": 3765700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e61199456b0748f9df3d11ee7f8ba584.avif?t=1783430036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras_big/e61199456b0748f9df3d11ee7f8ba584.avif?t=1783430036 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Summer of 1999. After years of begging, your parents have finally sent you off to Camp Lilypad, your dream sleep-away camp on a picturesque lake. Surely this will be a summer to remember. But one night, a fellow camper <i>double-dog-dares</i> you to “borrow” a rowboat and sneak into the neighboring camp across the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A camp full of clowns. And they don’t take too kindly to trespassers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/d0e5c8d680f61dfba7275790157cdac6.poster.avif?t=1783430036\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/d0e5c8d680f61dfba7275790157cdac6.webm?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/d0e5c8d680f61dfba7275790157cdac6.mp4?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/79c654e7f51beb1df2040b6e776f92c8.avif?t=1783430036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras_big/79c654e7f51beb1df2040b6e776f92c8.avif?t=1783430036 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Hide. Fight (<i>if you must</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until you can return to the safe side of the lake. Along the way, uncover the disturbing truth behind Clown Camp. Find environmental clues and postcards among the creaking cabins and bristling pine trees. A sharp eye will uncover many secrets hidden in the darkness (some of which may be best <i>left</i> unfound). Carefully manage a small inventory that is essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/8d18e4087564a594d43090d07aab9c3a.poster.avif?t=1783430036\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/8d18e4087564a594d43090d07aab9c3a.webm?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/8d18e4087564a594d43090d07aab9c3a.mp4?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/ab5efc010745cf70da60ff9d24968519.avif?t=1783430036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras_big/ab5efc010745cf70da60ff9d24968519.avif?t=1783430036 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bask in the dithered glow of a design philosophy inspired by the days when surviving horror required both courage AND skill. Low poly 3D models, uncanny animations, grainy filters, tight narrative, and challenging gameplay take center stage once again. Additional modern quality of life features provide wider accessibility options on top of an intentionally retro base experience throughout a 3-5 hour story mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/59477c57a5cb7a65f0eba63d0afcb0ac.poster.avif?t=1783430036\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/59477c57a5cb7a65f0eba63d0afcb0ac.webm?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/59477c57a5cb7a65f0eba63d0afcb0ac.mp4?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/e61199456b0748f9df3d11ee7f8ba584.avif?t=1783430036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras_big/e61199456b0748f9df3d11ee7f8ba584.avif?t=1783430036 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Summer of 1999. After years of begging, your parents have finally sent you off to Camp Lilypad, your dream sleep-away camp on a picturesque lake. Surely this will be a summer to remember. But one night, a fellow camper <i>double-dog-dares</i> you to “borrow” a rowboat and sneak into the neighboring camp across the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A camp full of clowns. And they don’t take too kindly to trespassers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/d0e5c8d680f61dfba7275790157cdac6.poster.avif?t=1783430036\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/d0e5c8d680f61dfba7275790157cdac6.webm?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/d0e5c8d680f61dfba7275790157cdac6.mp4?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/79c654e7f51beb1df2040b6e776f92c8.avif?t=1783430036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras_big/79c654e7f51beb1df2040b6e776f92c8.avif?t=1783430036 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Hide. Fight (<i>if you must</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until you can return to the safe side of the lake. Along the way, uncover the disturbing truth behind Clown Camp. Find environmental clues and postcards among the creaking cabins and bristling pine trees. A sharp eye will uncover many secrets hidden in the darkness (some of which may be best <i>left</i> unfound). Carefully manage a small inventory that is essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/8d18e4087564a594d43090d07aab9c3a.poster.avif?t=1783430036\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/8d18e4087564a594d43090d07aab9c3a.webm?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/8d18e4087564a594d43090d07aab9c3a.mp4?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/ab5efc010745cf70da60ff9d24968519.avif?t=1783430036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras_big/ab5efc010745cf70da60ff9d24968519.avif?t=1783430036 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bask in the dithered glow of a design philosophy inspired by the days when surviving horror required both courage AND skill. Low poly 3D models, uncanny animations, grainy filters, tight narrative, and challenging gameplay take center stage once again. Additional modern quality of life features provide wider accessibility options on top of an intentionally retro base experience throughout a 3-5 hour story mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/59477c57a5cb7a65f0eba63d0afcb0ac.poster.avif?t=1783430036\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/59477c57a5cb7a65f0eba63d0afcb0ac.webm?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/59477c57a5cb7a65f0eba63d0afcb0ac.mp4?t=1783430036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "First-Person Survival Horror, 90’s style. Hostile clowns lurk the woods. Fight-or-flight to uncover their gruesome secrets throughout a chilling Single-Player Story. Clever inventory management and resourcefulness are your only hopes to escape the Summer of 1999 alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with fu